      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that we should \"mind our own business\" is a moral failure that allows tyranny and chaos to spread unchecked, ultimately threatening the very freedoms we cherish at home. True leadership demands we stand up for human rights and global stability, because a world ruled by oppression is not a safe place for anyone, including our own citizens. Choosing neutrality is not a virtue; it is a cowardly surrender to the forces of darkness that will eventually consume us all. We must embrace our duty to lead and protect the world, because our strength is defined by our willingness to fight for justice everywhere.",
      "source": "target",
